#~ shadowed_macro
# fixedbugs, defect 2355: `CCC_OVERRIDE_OPTIONS` rewrites the `-fsyntax-only`
# only the compiler's probes carry into a `-D` of `__builtin_add_overflow`,
# and neither line the refusal asked of clang held that word: the constants'
# probe failed to link and the build stopped at exit 2 as the compiler's own
# failure. A line holding every word the compiler's jobs carry is asked of
# clang before any job runs (`cli/clang_jobs.hero`), and the `-D` it shows is
# refused; this line is its mark.

extern "lib.h"
    constant BUFSIZ: i64
    function lib_buffer() -> i64

function main()
    print(BUFSIZ)
    print(lib_buffer())
